<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>配眼镜 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%85%8D%E7%9C%BC%E9%95%9C/</link><description>Recent content in 配眼镜 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%85%8D%E7%9C%BC%E9%95%9C/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>眼科：验光配镜、隐形眼镜、眼睛干涩、眼底检查、眼镜店取镜</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/eye-doctor/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/eye-doctor/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;美国看眼睛分两种人：&lt;strong&gt;optometrist（OD，验光师）&lt;/strong&gt; 负责验光、配镜和常见眼病；&lt;strong&gt;ophthalmologist（MD，眼科医生）&lt;/strong&gt; 看眼病、做手术。常规验光配镜找 OD 就够了，需要手术或者复杂眼病，才会转到 MD 那边去。打电话约的时候说 &lt;code&gt;I'd like to schedule an eye exam&lt;/code&gt; 就行，诊所自己会安排。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>